  "components": {
    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "西风枪术 · 镝传",
        "title": "西风枪术 · 镝传",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/241eba6e4c00020975cf91170050f435_3278760421182591629.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>普通攻击</color>\n造成2点 <color=#ffffff>物理伤害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": null
      },
      {
        "key": "星霜的流旋",
        "title": "星霜的流旋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/ed9f203cd6405eca000741a0a95009c0_725833391025759395.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素战技</color>\n造成2点 <color=#36ffff>冰元素伤害</color> ，生成 <color=#ffffff>灵风</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>灵风</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出战状态</color>\n<color=#ffffff>我方角色「普通攻击」后：</color> 该角色本回合下次「普通攻击」少花费2个 <color=#ffffff>无色元素</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次数：1</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "苍翎的颂愿",
        "title": "苍翎的颂愿",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/143b8e76d41a9c74a09c00ae38ce27ad_5046294936636418897.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素爆发</color>\n治疗我方全体角色1点，生成 <color=#ffffff>鹰翎心得</color> 和 <color=#ffffff>鹰翎祝念</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>鹰翎心得</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出战状态</color>\n我方角色「普通攻击」少花费1个元素骰。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次数：2</color>\n<color=#ffffff>鹰翎祝念</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出战状态</color>\n我方角色「普通攻击」后治疗自身1点。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次数：2</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "速射牵制",
        "title": "速射牵制",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/a2a9542700e8a16645be739be4f58137_4731918718342405001.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>被动技能</color>\n【被动】 <color=#ffffff>自身使用技能后：</color> 下次我方造成的 <color=#ffffff>物理伤害</color> +1。（每回合2次）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "冰元素伤害",
        "title": "冰元素伤害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/4bcc4b82a9d7ee22770f60afa54e9919_6899594079109892123.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "附着冰元素，可发生元素反应：\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>融化</color> ：本伤害+2\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>超导</color> ：本伤害+1，对目标以外的所有敌方角色造成1点穿透伤害\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>冻结</color> ：本伤害+1，使目标本回合无法行动（受到物理或火元素伤害后提前解除，但是伤害+2）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "规则解释",
        "title": "规则解释",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_4274325088653613472.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理伤害</color>\n物理伤害不会附着元素，也不会发生元素反应。\n<color=#ffffff>无色元素</color>\n可以用任意类型的元素骰子组合，来支付此类费用。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次数</color>\n此牌效果触发后，会消耗1次可用次数；\n可用次数耗尽后，立刻弃置此牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ],
